            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.3+NUM.13.4+NUM.13.5+NUM.13.6+NUM.13.7+NUM.13.8+NUM.13.9+NUM.13.10+NUM.13.11+NUM.13.12+NUM.13.13+NUM.13.14+NUM.13.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.3",
              "NUM.13.4",
              "NUM.13.5",
              "NUM.13.6",
              "NUM.13.7",
              "NUM.13.8",
              "NUM.13.9",
              "NUM.13.10",
              "NUM.13.11",
              "NUM.13.12",
              "NUM.13.13",
              "NUM.13.14",
              "NUM.13.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵeleŵa ni ŵakusonda mwa asili ŵiŵatumisidwe ni Mose kukusonda mwa asili cilambo ca Kenani. Mose ŵamkolasile Hosheya mwanace jwa Nuni lina lyakuti Yoswa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mose piŵatumisyaga kuti ajawuleje, ŵasalile kuti, “Pakutyocela apano ajawule kumpoto kwa cilamboco ni akacijinjile kuja ku mbali ja kum'mwela ni akapelenganye mpaka ku cilambo ca matumbi ga Kenani. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akalolecesye kuti ana cili cilambo ca mtunduci, ana mwana ŵandu ŵalingwa ŵakutama mwelemo, nipo macili gawo gali gamtuli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akalolecesye naga cilamboco cili cambone kapena camtega nipo soni kuti ana ŵandu ŵakwe akutama m'matawuni gakulanguka kapena m'misinda jana mapupa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akalolecesye naga litaka lyakwe lyana cajila kapena soni naga cilamboco cana yitela. Nipo akaja kuliŵalila kwika nayo yisogosi yakusapanda kweleko.” (Jaliji ndaŵi jiyatandaga kwiwula yisogosi ya mpeleya).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo acalumewo ŵajile kumpoto kuja kwendelela cilambo cila kutyocela ku cipululu ca Sini kum'mwela ulendo mpaka ku Lehobu, kuŵandicila ku Mpata wa Hamati kumpoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ŵatandite kwawula ku mbali ja kum'mwela kwa cilamboco ni ŵayice ku Hebuloni, kugatamaga maŵele ga Ahimani, Sheshayi, ni Talimai yisukulu ya mtundu wa ŵandu ŵakulungwakulungwa ŵakolanjidwa Anakimu. (Hebuloni ali ataŵile papite yaka msano ni yiŵili mkinataŵe Sowani mu Iguputo). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵayice ku Ciŵata ca Eshikolo, nipo ŵakatile lunyambi pelepo lulwakwete cisagwa ca mpeleya mwakuti ŵakamusyangene acalume ŵaŵili tucinyakula cisagwaco pa citela jwine pasogolo jwine kunyuma. Jemanjajo ŵajigele soni yisogosi ya pomugalaneti ni nguju. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "(Gele malogo gakolanjidwe kuti, Ciŵata ca Eshikolo ligongo lyacisagwa ca mpeleya ciŵacikatile Aisalaeli pelepo).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali ajendele cilambo cila kwa masiku 40, ŵakusonda ŵala ŵawujile ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwa Mose, Aloni",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ni likuga lyosope lya Aisalaeli ku Kadeshi mcipululu ca Palani. Ŵalondesye yosope yiŵayiweni nipo ŵalosisye yisogosi yiŵayice nayoyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jemanjajo ŵatite kwa Mose, “Uwe tusondile mwa asili cilambo cila ni tuciweni kuti cakusicila soni cana cajila, ayi ni yine mwa yisogosi yakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵandu ŵakutama kweleko ali ŵamacili, nipo misinda jawo jili jajikulungwa mnope soni jana mapupa gakwe. Cakupunda kusakala ni aci, twayiweni yisukulu ya Aanaki kweleko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amaleki akutama mbali ja kum'mwela kwa cilamboco, Ahiti, Ayebusi, ni Aamoli akutama ku cilambo ca ku matumbi, nipo Akenani akutama ciŵandika ni Nyasa ja Mediteleniyani ni mungulugulu Lusulo lwa Yolodani.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo Kalebu ŵatondweye ŵandu ŵiŵadandawulaga mwakusisyana ni Mose, ni ŵatite kuti, “Kwende tukatande sambano jino nipo tukacijigale cilamboco, tuli ŵakulimba mnope mwakuti tutukacisumule cenenepe.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nambo ŵandu ŵiŵalongene ni Kalebu ŵala ŵatite kuti, “Iyayi, uwe nganitukola macili gakuja kukwatanda jemanjajo, pakuŵapo ŵandu ŵakwe ali ŵamacili kutupunda uwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Myoyo jemanjajo ŵajenesye ngani ja unami pasikati pa Aisalaeli jakwamba cilambo ciŵacisondile mwa asili. Ŵaŵecetaga kuti, “Cilamboco cangasogola atamose yakulya yakwanila yakwalisya ŵandu ŵakutama kweleko. Jwalijose jutwam'weni jwaliji jwamlewu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 13:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nipo soni twaweni ŵandu ŵakulungwakulungwa kweleko, yisukulu ya Aanaki. Uwe twagambile kuŵa mpela yitete, nipo amu ni mutuwoneceleje uwe kwa jemanjajo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.13.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.13.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
